  <!-- v2 tested exclusions:
    Removed factions that returned NO ELIGIBLE MEMBERS during wish testing.
    Exclusions were applied to both RegularFactions and HeroFactions because
    both team generators use the same +/-10-level faction-member eligibility logic.
--><!--
    Subterranean Sites DEV - tiered faction selectors.

    RegularFactions:
      Used by the planned non-hero faction-team builder.

    HeroFactions:
      Used by vanilla FactionEncounters, which promotes the first
      selected faction member into a hero/legendary leader.

    Weights are the design weights selected during the Tier 1-8 review.
    Hero eligibility always implies regular eligibility.

    IMPORTANT:
      These tables choose a faction only. They do not guarantee that a
      faction has enough level-appropriate members to produce a useful
      team at every tier. Wish testing is intended to identify those cases.
  -->

